{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52648","headline":"□□州别驾□皇□从□□□闻下（下缺） · □州司马","name":"□□州别驾□皇□从□□□闻下（下缺）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻□□□才，□春复赏梅。\n咏□幽山桂，传声□□□。\n□□□□□，□□□□□。\n□□□君酒，花□妓女杯。\n淮南有便使，□摘一枝来。\n□□史（下缺。\n同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"□州司马","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52648.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52648","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}